## Error Handling

### Field-Level Errors

```typescript
// Automatic error display through FormInput
<FormInput
  control={control}
  id="email"
  label="Email"
  errorText={errors.email?.message} // Displays validation errors
/>
```

### Custom Error States

```typescript
const [showTermsError, setShowTermsError] = useState(false)

const onSubmit = useCallback((data: FormData) => {
  if (!data.termsAccepted) {
    setShowTermsError(true)
    return
  }
  setShowTermsError(false)
  // Process form
}, [])
```

